{"seq":4,"slug":"development-workflows","title":"开发工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/development-workflows","wordCount":899,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"开发工作流\">开发工作流</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Compose 将整套开发基础设施打包为一份声明式文件，新成员只需 <code>docker compose up</code> 即可获得完整环境，消除&quot;在我机器上能跑&quot;的问题。</p>\n<p>开发工作流围绕四个概念：<strong>多阶段 Dockerfile</strong> 用 <code>target</code> 在 dev/production 阶段间切换；<strong>绑定挂载</strong>源码实现热重载；<strong>多文件覆盖</strong>管理环境差异；<strong>调试命令</strong>（<code>logs</code>、<code>exec</code>、<code>top</code>、<code>stats</code>）支撑故障排查。再配合初始化脚本与 <code>.env.example</code> 模板，即可把环境搭建门槛降到一条命令。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基于-compose-的本地开发环境\">基于 Compose 的本地开发环境</h2><p>Docker Compose 将整个应用的基础设施打包为一个声明式配置文件，新成员只需 <code>docker compose up</code> 即可获得完整的开发环境，消除了&quot;在我机器上能跑&quot;的经典问题。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  api:&#10;    build:&#10;      context: ./api&#10;      target: dev&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./api/src:/app/src:cached&#10;      - /app/node_modules&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;3000:3000&#39;&#10;      - &#39;9229:9229&#39;&#10;    environment:&#10;      NODE_ENV: development&#10;      DATABASE_URL: postgres://dev:dev@db:5432/myapp_dev&#10;      REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379&#10;    command: [&#39;npx&#39;, &#39;nodemon&#39;, &#39;--inspect=0.0.0.0:9229&#39;, &#39;src/index.js&#39;]&#10;    depends_on:&#10;      db:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;      redis:&#10;        condition: service_healthy&#10;&#10;  web:&#10;    build:&#10;      context: ./web&#10;      target: dev&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - ./web/src:/app/src:cached&#10;      - /app/node_modules&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;5173:5173&#39;&#10;    environment:&#10;      VITE_API_URL: http://localhost:3000&#10;&#10;  db:&#10;    image: postgres:16-alpine&#10;    environment:&#10;      POSTGRES_DB: myapp_dev&#10;      POSTGRES_USER: dev&#10;      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: dev&#10;    volumes:&#10;      - pgdata:/var/lib/postgresql/data&#10;      - ./scripts/init-db.sql:/docker-entrypoint-initdb.d/init.sql:ro&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;5432:5432&#39;&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD-SHELL&#39;, &#39;pg_isready -U dev&#39;]&#10;      interval: 5s&#10;      timeout: 3s&#10;      retries: 10&#10;&#10;  redis:&#10;    image: redis:7-alpine&#10;    ports:&#10;      - &#39;6379:6379&#39;&#10;    healthcheck:&#10;      test: [&#39;CMD&#39;, &#39;redis-cli&#39;, &#39;ping&#39;]&#10;      interval: 5s&#10;      timeout: 3s&#10;      retries: 10&#10;&#10;volumes:&#10;  pgdata:\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api/s