style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">5s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">3s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      retries</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">volumes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pgdata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    DEV[开发者] --&gt;|编辑代码| SRC[源码目录]&#10;    SRC --&gt;|绑定挂载| API[api 容器&lt;br/&gt;nodemon 热重载]&#10;    SRC --&gt;|绑定挂载| WEB[web 容器&lt;br/&gt;Vite HMR]&#10;    API --&gt; DB[PostgreSQL]&#10;    API --&gt; REDIS[Redis]&#10;    WEB --&gt;|API 调用| API\">graph TD\n    DEV[开发者] --&gt;|编辑代码| SRC[源码目录]\n    SRC --&gt;|绑定挂载| API[api 容器&lt;br/&gt;nodemon 热重载]\n    SRC --&gt;|绑定挂载| WEB[web 容器&lt;br/&gt;Vite HMR]\n    API --&gt; DB[PostgreSQL]\n    API --&gt; REDIS[Redis]\n    WEB --&gt;|API 调用| API</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开发工具</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>容器内实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>热重载</td>\n<td>代码修改自动重启</td>\n<td>nodemon / tsx watch</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMR</td>\n<td>前端模块热替换</td>\n<td>Vite / webpack</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调试器</td>\n<td>远程断点调试</td>\n<td>--inspect=0.0.0.0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库 GUI</td>\n<td>可视化管理数据</td>\n<td>映射端口到宿主机</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"多阶段-dockerfile-的开发模式\">多阶段 Dockerfile 的开发模式</h2><p>通过 Dockerfile 的 <code>target</code> 参数，同一个 Dockerfile 可以服务于开发和生产两种构建模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"dockerfile\" data-code=\"FROM node:20-alpine AS base&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./&#10;RUN corepack enable&#10;&#10;FROM base AS dev&#10;RUN pnpm install&#10;CMD [&quot;npx&quot;, &quot;nodemon&quot;, &quot;src/index.js&quot;]&#10;&#10;FROM base AS build&#10;RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile&#10;COPY . .&#10;RUN pnpm build&#10;&#10;FROM node:20-alpine AS production&#10;WORKDIR /app&#10;COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist&#10;COPY --from=build /app/node_modules ./node_modules&#10;USER 1000:1000&#10;CMD [&quot;node&quot;, &quot;dist/index.js&quot;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS base</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY package.json pnpm-lock.yaml ./</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN corepack enable</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM base AS dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm install</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"npx\", \"nodemon\", \"src/index.js\"]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM base AS build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm install --frozen-lockfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY . .</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>RUN pnpm build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>FROM node:20-alpine AS production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>WORKDIR /app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=build /app/dist ./dist</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>COPY --from=build /app/node_modules ./node_modules</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>USER 1000:1000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>CMD [\"node\", \"dist/index.js\"]</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    DF[Dockerfile] --&gt;|target: dev| DEV[开发镜像&lt;br/&gt;含 devDependencies&lt;br/&gt;nodemon]&#10;    DF --&gt;|target: production| PROD[生产镜像&lt;br/&gt;仅 dist + deps&lt;br/&gt;最小化]\">graph LR\n    DF[Dockerfile] --&gt;|target: dev| DEV[开发镜像&lt;br/&gt;含 devDependencies&lt;br/&gt;nodemon]\n    DF --&gt;|target: production| PROD[生产镜像&lt;br/&gt;仅 dist + deps&lt;br/&gt;最小化]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>构建阶段</th>\n<th>包含内容</th>\n<th>镜像大小</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>dev</td>\n<td>全部依赖 + 开发工具</td>\n<td>较大</td>\n<td>本地开发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>build</td>\n<td>编译构建产物</td>\n<td>中间阶段</td>\n<td>构建过程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>production</td>\n<td>仅运行时依赖 + 产物</td>\n<td>最小</td>\n<td>生产部署</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 开发阶段不需要 <code>COPY . .</code> 复制源码到镜像，因为源码通过绑定挂载实时同步。这样每次代码修改无需重新构建镜像，极大提升开发效率。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"环境差异管理\">环境差异管理</h2><p>使用多文件覆盖策略管理开发、测试和生产环境的配置差异。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"services:&#10;  api:&#10;    build:&#10;      context: ./api&#10;      target: production&#10;    deploy:&#10;      replicas: 2&#10;      resources:&#10;        limits:&#10;          cpus: &#39;1.0&#39;&#10;          memory: 512M&#10;    environment:&#10;      NODE_ENV: production&#10;      LOG_LEVEL: warn&#10;    restart: unless-stopped\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">services</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  api</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    build</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">./api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      target</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    deploy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      replicas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      resources</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        limits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          cpus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1.0'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          memory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">512M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    environment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      NODE_ENV</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">production</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      LOG_LEVEL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">warn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    restart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unless-stopped</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.dev.yaml up -d&#10;&#10;docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.prod.yaml up -d&#10;&#10;docker compose -f compose.yaml -f compose.test.yaml run --rm test\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.dev.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.prod.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose.test.yaml</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> run</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rm</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>环境</th>\n<th>覆盖文件</th>\n<th>关键差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>开发</td>\n<td>compose.dev.yaml</td>\n<td>源码挂载、调试端口、热重载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试</td>\n<td>compose.test.yaml</td>\n<td>测试数据库、隔离网络</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预发布</td>\n<td>compose.staging.yaml</td>\n<td>真实配置、资源限制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产</td>\n<td>compose.prod.yaml</td>\n<td>副本数、重启策略、资源限制</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    BASE[compose.yaml&lt;br/&gt;通用配置] --&gt;|合并| DEV[compose.dev.yaml]&#10;    BASE --&gt;|合并| TEST[compose.test.yaml]&#10;    BASE --&gt;|合并| PROD[compose.prod.yaml]&#10;    DEV --&gt; DEVENV[开发环境]&#10;    TEST --&gt; TESTENV[测试环境]&#10;    PROD --&gt; PRODENV[生产环境]\">graph TD\n    BASE[compose.yaml&lt;br/&gt;通用配置] --&gt;|合并| DEV[compose.dev.yaml]\n    BASE --&gt;|合并| TEST[compose.test.yaml]\n    BASE --&gt;|合并| PROD[compose.prod.yaml]\n    DEV --&gt; DEVENV[开发环境]\n    TEST --&gt; TESTENV[测试环境]\n    PROD --&gt; PRODENV[生产环境]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试与故障排查\">调试与故障排查</h2><p>容器化环境的调试需要掌握特定的工具和技巧。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"docker compose logs -f --tail 100 api&#10;&#10;docker compose exec api sh&#10;&#10;docker compose exec api node --inspect=0.0.0.0:9229 -e &quot;debugger&quot;&#10;&#10;docker compose top&#10;&#10;docker stats --format &quot;table {{.Name}}\\t{{.CPUPerc}}\\t{{.MemUsage}}\\t{{.NetIO}}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> logs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tail</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> node</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --inspect=0.0.0.0:9229</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -e</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"debugger\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> top</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> stats</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"table {{.Name}}\\t{{.CPUPerc}}\\t{{.MemUsage}}\\t{{.NetIO}}\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常见问题排查流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    ISSUE[容器问题] --&gt; CHECK{docker compose ps}&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|Exited| LOGS[docker compose logs]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|Running but unhealthy| HC[检查 healthcheck]&#10;    CHECK --&gt;|Running healthy| EXEC[docker compose exec]&#10;    LOGS --&gt; FIX1[修复代码/配置]&#10;    HC --&gt; FIX2[调整健康检查参数]&#10;    EXEC --&gt; NET[网络连通性测试]&#10;    EXEC --&gt; DISK[磁盘空间检查]&#10;    NET --&gt; DNS[nslookup 服务名]&#10;    NET --&gt; PING[ping / curl 测试]\">graph TD\n    ISSUE[容器问题] --&gt; CHECK{docker compose ps}\n    CHECK --&gt;|Exited| LOGS[docker compose logs]\n    CHECK --&gt;|Running but unhealthy| HC[检查 healthcheck]\n    CHECK --&gt;|Running healthy| EXEC[docker compose exec]\n    LOGS --&gt; FIX1[修复代码/配置]\n    HC --&gt; FIX2[调整健康检查参数]\n    EXEC --&gt; NET[网络连通性测试]\n    EXEC --&gt; DISK[磁盘空间检查]\n    NET --&gt; DNS[nslookup 服务名]\n    NET --&gt; PING[ping / curl 测试]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>调试命令</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>docker compose logs -f</td>\n<td>实时查看服务日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker compose exec sh</td>\n<td>进入容器交互式 shell</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker compose top</td>\n<td>查看容器内进程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker compose events</td>\n<td>实时事件流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker stats</td>\n<td>资源使用监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>docker compose config</td>\n<td>验证最终合并配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 使用 <code>nicolaka/netshoot</code> 镜像作为网络调试容器，它预装了 curl、dig、nslookup、tcpdump 等网络诊断工具。通过 <code>docker compose run --rm netshoot</code> 可以快速排查容器间的网络问题。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"项目初始化脚本\">项目初始化脚本</h2><p>为团队成员提供一键启动的开发环境初始化体验。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"#!/usr/bin/env bash&#10;set -euo pipefail&#10;&#10;if [ ! -f .env ]; then&#10;  cp .env.example .env&#10;  echo &quot;Created .env from .env.example&quot;&#10;fi&#10;&#10;docker compose pull&#10;docker compose build&#10;docker compose up -d&#10;docker compose exec api npx prisma migrate dev&#10;echo &quot;Development environment is ready!&quot;&#10;echo &quot;API:      http://localhost:3000&quot;&#10;echo &quot;Frontend: http://localhost:5173&quot;&#10;echo &quot;DB:       localhost:5432&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">#!/usr/bin/env bash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">set</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -euo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pipefail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> .env ]; </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  cp</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env.example</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> .env</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Created .env from .env.example\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">fi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> up</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> exec</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> api</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> npx</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prisma</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> migrate</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Development environment is ready!\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"API:      http://localhost:3000\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Frontend: http://localhost:5173\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">echo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"DB:       localhost:5432\"</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>初始化步骤</th>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>环境配置</td>\n<td>cp .env.example .env</td>\n<td>创建本地环境文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉取镜像</td>\n<td>docker compose pull</td>\n<td>获取基础镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建服务</td>\n<td>docker compose build</td>\n<td>构建自定义镜像</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动服务</td>\n<td>docker compose up -d</td>\n<td>后台启动所有服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据库迁移</td>\n<td>docker compose exec migrate</td>\n<td>初始化数据库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((开发工作流))&#10;    本地环境&#10;      一键启动&#10;      绑定挂载&#10;      热重载&#10;    多阶段构建&#10;      dev 开发阶段&#10;      production 生产阶段&#10;      target 切换&#10;    环境管理&#10;      多文件覆盖&#10;      .env 变量&#10;      profiles 按需启动&#10;    调试技巧&#10;      日志查看&#10;      exec 交互&#10;      netshoot 网络诊断&#10;    团队协作&#10;      初始化脚本&#10;      .env.example&#10;      文档化启动流程\">mindmap\n  root((开发工作流))\n    本地环境\n      一键启动\n      绑定挂载\n      热重载\n    多阶段构建\n      dev 开发阶段\n      production 生产阶段\n      target 切换\n    环境管理\n      多文件覆盖\n      .env 变量\n      profiles 按需启动\n    调试技巧\n      日志查看\n      exec 交互\n      netshoot 网络诊断\n    团队协作\n      初始化脚本\n      .env.example\n      文档化启动流程</pre><ul>\n<li>Docker Compose 让团队成员通过 <code>docker compose up</code> 一键获得完整的本地开发环境。</li>\n<li>多阶段 Dockerfile 通过 <code>target</code> 参数在开发和生产模式间切换，开发阶段通过绑定挂载同步源码。</li>\n<li>使用多文件覆盖策略（compose.yaml + compose.dev.yaml）管理不同环境的配置差异。</li>\n<li>掌握 <code>logs</code>、<code>exec</code>、<code>top</code>、<code>stats</code> 等调试命令是容器化环境故障排查的基础。</li>\n<li>为团队提供初始化脚本和 <code>.env.example</code> 模板，降低环境搭建门槛。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"开发工作流","id":"开发工作流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基于 Compose 的本地开发环境","id":"基于-compose-的本地开发环境"},{"level":2,"text":"多阶段 Dockerfile 的开发模式","id":"多阶段-dockerfile-的开发模式"},{"level":2,"text":"环境差异管理","id":"环境差异管理"},{"level":2,"text":"调试与故障排查","id":"调试与故障排查"},{"level":2,"text":"项目初始化脚本","id":"项目初始化脚本"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"数据卷与持久化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/docker-compose/volumes-and-persistence"},"next":{"title":"架构与概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/devops-containerization/kubernetes-essentials/architecture-and-concepts"}}